L75: ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS
L76: This study was conceived and conducted as part of a course, entitled Laboratory Methods in Human Physiology (BIOL 4790/5790), at the University of Colorado Colorado Springs, which was supported in part from a grant from the Medical Education and Research Institute of Colorado. All student authors contributed equally to each phase of the project, including planning and design, obtaining Institutional Review Board approval, data collection, analysis, and manuscript preparation. The authors express their gratitude to the students who volunteered for and assisted with the study.
